---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - JamBuddy" description="Learn about the story behind JamBuddy and our mission to enhance musical creativity and collaboration.">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-black to-gray-900 text-white py-20 rounded-lg relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-30 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_30%_20%,rgba(60,150,255,0.25),transparent_60%),radial-gradient(circle_at_70%_70%,rgba(0,200,140,0.2),transparent_60%)]"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 id="about-heading" class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-blue-100 to-green-100 bg-clip-text text-transparent">About JamBuddy</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        JamBuddy is a focused, distraction-free practice companion that helps musicians <span class="text-white font-semibold">listen, learn, and play</span> music faster. Real-time chord detection powered by neural network pitch detection, seven visualization modes, and organized song management—all working 100% offline with complete privacy.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 text-sm" aria-label="Key principles">
        <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-gray-200">Offline • No Ads</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-gray-200">One‑Time Purchase</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-gray-200">Real‑Time Chord Engine</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-gray-200">Multi‑Instrument</span>
        <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-gray-200">Privacy First</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-900 rounded-lg" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 id="story-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Why I Built JamBuddy</h2>
          <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg text-gray-300 max-w-none">
            <p class="mb-6">I started learning songs the slow, frustrating way—pausing videos, guessing chords, scribbling messy progressions, and losing momentum. Existing apps either locked features behind subscriptions, harvested data, or buried the core tools under clutter.</p>
            <p class="mb-6">So I built what I wished existed: a <strong>fast, offline, no‑nonsense environment</strong> that helps you identify chords as you listen, internalize rhythm visually, loop tricky parts, and log ideas the moment they hit.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">JamBuddy is still evolving weekly. Every refinement is guided by a simple question: <em>Does this help someone learn or teach music faster with less friction?</em></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-purple-500/20 relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 via-blue-500 to-green-500"></div>
          <div class="relative text-center">
            <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 to-purple-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg">
              <span class="text-white text-3xl font-bold">JB</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Goal</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">Remove friction between <em>hearing</em> something inspiring and <em>turning it into music you can play or teach</em>. JamBuddy should feel like a minimal, powerful instrument—not a gamified platform competing for attention.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm text-left">
              <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-3 border border-white/5"><span class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">No Dark Patterns</span><span class="text-gray-400">Own it once. No upsells.</span></div>
              <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-3 border border-white/5"><span class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Local Processing</span><span class="text-gray-400">Audio stays on device.</span></div>
              <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-3 border border-white/5"><span class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Fast Feedback</span><span class="text-gray-400">Low‑latency detection.</span></div>
              <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-3 border border-white/5"><span class="block text-white font-semibold mb-1">Teacher Friendly</span><span class="text-gray-400">Organize songs & sets.</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- App Principles -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-900/80 rounded-lg mt-8" aria-labelledby="principles-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="principles-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Product Principles</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Every design & feature decision filters through these guardrails.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-500/20">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 font-bold text-lg text-white">1</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Beginner Friendly</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Fast wins build momentum: instant chords, clear rhythm, zero setup overhead. Learn songs—not software.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-green-500/20">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 font-bold text-lg text-white">2</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Simple & Useful</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">No dashboards, feed algorithms, or gamified clutter. Only the tools that shorten the gap between listening and playing.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-purple-500/20">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-purple-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 font-bold text-lg text-white">3</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Constantly Improving</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Micro-iterations weekly: performance tweaks, detection accuracy boosts, teacher workflow refinements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About the Developer -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-900 rounded-lg mt-8" aria-labelledby="developer-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="developer-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">About the Developer</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Student of music and technology, and builder of tools that reduce friction for creative learners.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-12">
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl border border-blue-500/20 max-w-3xl">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start text-left">
            <div class="w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 shadow-lg">
              <span class="text-white text-3xl font-bold">JB</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
              <p>I want JamBuddy to help people learn music and feel confident in their abilities. New ideas are always welcome.</p>
              <p>If you’re an educator piloting JamBuddy in a classroom or ensemble setting, I’d love to hear how students are using it and what would accelerate your workflow next.</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Want to reach out? Use the <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline">contact page</a> or email directly.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- App Features -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-lg mt-8" aria-labelledby="capabilities-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="capabilities-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Core Capabilities</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">Foundational tools that speed up the listen → learn → create cycle.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-center">
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-700 text-left">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gray-700 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15.536 8.464a5 5 0 010 7.072m2.828-9.9a9 9 0 010 12.728M5.586 15H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h1.586l4.707-4.707C10.923 3.663 12 4.109 12 5v14c0 .891-1.077 1.337-1.707.707L5.586 15z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">🎧 Real-Time Chord Recognition</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">CREPE neural network pitch detection with Circle of Fifths overlay, next-chord predictions, and integrated tuner. Supports guitar, bass, ukulele, mandolin, baritone ukulele & fiddle.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-700 text-left">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gray-700 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">📚 Practice Tools</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Chromatic tuner, visual metronome (20-300 BPM) with strum patterns, audio slowdown from 5%-250% without pitch change, looping, and built-in recorder.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-700 text-left">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gray-700 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">✍️ Tunes Library</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Thousands of tunes included. ABC sheet music with tablature, lyrics, audio attachments, and PDF support. Transpose to any key, print publication-quality output.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-700 text-left">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gray-700 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center"></div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">🎸 Multi-Instrument Support</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Guitar, bass, ukulele, mandolin, baritone ukulele, and fiddle. Chord charts, fretboard visualization, and tablature for each instrument.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Explore More -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-900/80 rounded-lg mt-8" aria-labelledby="explore-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="explore-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Explore More</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Dig deeper into JamBuddy and get in touch.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <a href="/features" class="group bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-500/20 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">Features</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">A full breakdown of everything JamBuddy can do—chord detection, practice tools, and more.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/external-links" class="group bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-green-500/20 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-green-300 transition-colors">External Links</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Helpful resources, communities, and related tools we recommend.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/contact" class="group bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-purple-500/20 hover:border-purple-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">Contact</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Questions, feedback, or ideas? Reach out and let us know.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="relative py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900 via-purple-900 to-blue-900 rounded-xl mt-8 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600/20 via-purple-600/20 to-green-600/20"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-blue-100 to-green-100 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Get JamBuddy Now</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-200 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        JamBuddy is now available! Download the app and start learning your favorite songs today.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 justify-center">
        <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jambuddy.app&pcampaignid=web_share" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group bg-gradient-to-r from-white/20 to-white/10 border-2 border-white/30 backdrop-blur-sm text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-bold text-xl hover:from-white/30 hover:to-white/20 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center shadow-2xl transform hover:scale-105">
          <img src="/images/icons/google-play-badge.png" alt="Get it on Google Play" class="h-12 mr-4 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" />
          Get on Google Play
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-gray-800/80 border-2 border-gray-600 text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-bold text-xl hover:bg-gray-700/80 hover:border-gray-500 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center backdrop-blur-sm transform hover:scale-105">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 mr-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
          </svg>
          Send Feedback
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Formerly the homepage; moved here when /abc (Sheet Music) became the new landing page. -->

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-black to-gray-900 border-b border-gray-800 rounded-lg mt-8">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-30 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_20%_20%,rgba(236,72,153,0.25),transparent_60%),radial-gradient(circle_at_80%_70%,rgba(34,197,94,0.2),transparent_60%)]"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-300 bg-pink-500/10 border border-pink-500/30 rounded-full px-3 py-1 mb-6">Android &middot; Wear OS &middot; Offline</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">Read, hear, and learn tunes faster.</h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-xl">JamBuddy renders ABC sheet music to fit your screen, listens for chords in real time, and gives you tab, MIDI playback, audio looping, a tuner and a metronome &mdash; all in one app, all offline.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-8">
          <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.jambuddy.app&pcampaignid=web_share" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg shadow-lg transition-colors">
            <img src="/images/icons/google-play-badge.png" alt="" class="h-8" />
            Get on Google Play
          </a>
          <a href="/abc" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-colors">Browse sheet music &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/80 border border-gray-700 rounded-full text-gray-300">Works offline</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/80 border border-gray-700 rounded-full text-gray-300">No account required</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/80 border border-gray-700 rounded-full text-gray-300">No ads, ever</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-gray-800/80 border border-gray-700 rounded-full text-gray-300">Thousands of tunes included</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-tr from-pink-500/20 via-purple-500/10 to-cyan-500/20 blur-2xl rounded-3xl"></div>
        <div class="relative bg-gray-800/80 rounded-2xl p-3 border border-gray-700 shadow-2xl">
          <img src="/images/features/full_screen_abc.png" alt="JamBuddy showing a full tune of sheet music scaled to a phone screen" class="rounded-xl w-full max-w-md mx-auto" loading="eager" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Nav -->
  <nav class="bg-gray-800/50 border-b border-gray-700 py-3 overflow-x-auto">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <ul class="flex gap-6 text-sm text-gray-300 whitespace-nowrap">
        <li><a href="#sheet-music" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Sheet Music</a></li>
        <li><a href="#three-windows" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Three Windows</a></li>
        <li><a href="#tunes-window" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Tunes Window</a></li>
        <li><a href="#visualization-window" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Visualization</a></li>
        <li><a href="#tools-window" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Tools</a></li>
        <li><a href="#chord-detection" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Chord Detection</a></li>
        <li><a href="#wear-os" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Wear OS</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">

    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        JamBuddy is a practice app built around readable sheet music. ABC notation renders at whatever size fits your screen&mdash;fiddle tunes stay legible even on a phone without scrolling. Add tablature, transpose to any key, play back with MIDI, and edit everything right in the app.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ABC Sheet Music - LEAD FEATURE -->
    <section id="sheet-music" class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-10 h-10 bg-pink-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg">🎼</span>
        ABC Sheet Music Rendering
      </h2>

      <!-- Hero image: full screen sheet music -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 mb-8">
        <img src="/images/features/full_screen_abc.png" alt="Full sheet music scaled to fit phone screen" class="rounded-lg w-full max-w-md mx-auto" />
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-3 text-center">Sheet music scales to fill your screen. The tune displays completely without scrolling.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Scales to fit your screen</h3>
          <p>The sheet music renderer automatically sizes notation to fill the available space. A two-part fiddle tune displays large enough to read across the room on a tablet, or comfortably on a phone without scrolling. The app only scrolls vertically when necessary to keep the music from becoming too small.</p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6">Tablature for fretted instruments</h3>
          <p>Enable tablature and it appears below the standard notation. Supported instruments:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-pink-400">•</span> Guitar (standard tuning)</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-pink-400">•</span> Mandolin (GDAE)</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-pink-400">•</span> Ukulele (GCEA)</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-pink-400">•</span> Baritone Ukulele (DGBE)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">Tab shows fret numbers on string lines, making it easier to learn pieces if you read tab more fluently than standard notation.</p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6">Transpose and change clef</h3>
          <p>Transpose any tune up or down by semitones—the notation updates instantly. Switch between treble, bass, alto, or tenor clef. Useful when adapting a tune to your instrument's range or matching a recording in a different key.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
            <img src="/images/features/guitar and uke chords.png" alt="Tablature instrument selector showing Guitar, Mandolin, Ukulele options" class="rounded-lg w-full" />
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-3">Choose your instrument for tablature: Guitar, Mandolin, Ukulele, or Baritone Ukulele.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
            <img src="/images/features/sheet%20music%20with%20guitar%20tab.png" alt="Sheet music with guitar tablature" class="rounded-lg w-full" />
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-3">Standard notation with guitar tablature below.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sheet music + fretboard visualization -->
      <div class="mt-8 bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-center">
          <div>
            <img src="/images/features/abc_with_transcription_dialog.png" alt="Tablature instrument selector showing None, Guitar, Mandolin, Ukulele, Baritone Ukulele options" class="rounded-lg w-full" />
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-3 text-center">Select your instrument for tablature generation.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
